  "findings": [
    "Fourth Edition Angry Mob and Uncle Istvan originalText and Mirage Mtenda Herder originalText match reviewed rules wording.",
    "Do not apply originalType: these old creature records have modern types.",
    "Legacy ocT is a tap-symbol token; normalize to {T} while retaining rawOriginalText.",
    "Coverage describes populated fields, not scan-reviewed typography. Missing originalText is not assumed to mean an empty text box.",
    "Fourth Edition Deathgrip originalText omits the colon after {B}{B}; recorded against the scan in centered-transfer-review.json. Printing-reference is not scan-reviewed certification.",
    "Fourth Edition Regeneration originalText also omits the activation colon. Deathgrip and Regeneration have scan-hashed colon corrections in 4ed/annotations-centered.json; cached source bytes remain unchanged.",
    "Revised Holy Armor originalText omits the colon after {W}; its newline corresponds to the printed two-line block, not clearly a paragraph boundary. The new registration baseline retains the raw source interpretation and flags this in 3ed/frame-registration-measurement.json. Correct and freeze its inputs before using it for typography tuning.",
    "Revised Blessing also omits the activation colon in MTGJSON; scan-hashed annotations-revised-centered-final.json corrects it and the curly apostrophes in Cursed Land and Wanderlust. These three changed inputs are excluded from renderer-only paired deltas."
  ]
